      "content": "It sounds like you may have injured your back, possibly a strained or torn muscle, considering the pain and location. While over-the-counter pain relievers like ibuprofen can help reduce pain and inflammation, it's important to avoid resting too much and let your body heal. Consult a healthcare professional to get an accurate diagnosis and appropriate treatment. In the meantime, try to rest and avoid heavy lifting or strenuous activity to allow your muscles to recover.",
